From: Devario maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] use native key and database helpers at runtime

Devario intentionally does not install the pacman or pacman-key executables.
Use Shelly's own key helper for supported keyring operations, invoke GnuPG
directly for network key operations, and resolve pacfile ownership from the
local ALPM database instead of spawning pacman -Qoq.

